      "title": "the Shipping Corporation of India Limited Appoints Uttam Gharde as Deputy Chief Vigilance Officer and Senior Management Member, Effective January 1, 2026",
      "body": "The Shipping Corporation of India Limited has informed that by virtue of internal order, Mr. Uttam Gharde has taken charge of Vigilance Division as Deputy Chief Vigilance Officer and is now forming part of senior management of the Company. Mr. Uttam Sadashiv Gharde holds a Bachelor’s degree in Mechanical Engineering and is a Marine Engineer (MEO Class I). He has over 33 years of experience in various business verticals in maritime training, fleet personnel, ship operation, dry dock operation and repair bill settlement. He joined SCI as a Fifth Engineer Officer in August 1992 and began sailing on vessels from August 18, 1992. He joined shore cadre on April 7, 2006 and was promoted to the position of Deputy General Manager in April 2019. The appointment is effective from January 1, 2026.",
